OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested in village murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murdering a woman in Lincolnshire.
OL,9,FOfficers were called to a property on
OL,10,FThames Street, in Hogsthorpe, near
OL,11,FSkegness, at about 09:00 BST on Tuesday
OL,12,Ffollowing a report that a woman in her
OL,13,F30s had died, Lincolnshire Police said.
OL,15,FThe arrested men, in their 50s and 60s,
OL,16,Fremain in police custody.
OL,18,FA police spokesperson said they do not
OL,19,Fbelieve there is a wider risk to the
OL,20,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
